],"cards":[{"dot":"cyan","title":"Execution evidence","items":["Dockerfile installs Chromium and starts node gold-agent.js. The image can run the same source inside a container.","No Task Scheduler export exists in the repository; project notes document a Windows task action that starts Node directly rather than docker run."]},{"dot":"emerald","title":"Business rule","items":["The code tests lastGoldRate === null || lastGoldRate !== goldRate.","An equal rate only logs. Message creation, Telegram delivery, and state write are skipped.","The saved rate is updated only after sendTelegramMessage() completes successfully."]},{"dot":"rose","title":"Failure and secrets","items":["A missing scraper element can time out after 10 seconds. Telegram transport/API errors are logged, rethrown, and caught by the agent. No retry is implemented.","TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN comes from process.env; .env is ignored by Git and Docker build context. The chat ID is currently a source constant, displayed here as redacted."]}]}
